<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-hejingying-ws2074177">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0000" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">鬱林王何妃</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0006" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">婧英</persName>，廬江𤄵人，撫軍將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0018" ref="pbz_pni_tco_A">戢</persName>之女也。永明二年，納為南郡王妃。十一年，為皇太孫妃。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0045" ref="iop_ybd_afm">鬱林王</persName>即位，為<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0052" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">皇后</persName>。嫡母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0057" ref="7er_nz6_bcf">劉氏</persName>為高昌縣都鄉君，所生母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0070" ref="aef_j2f_3lc">宋氏</persName>，為餘杭廣昌鄉君。將拜，鏡在床無故墮地。其冬，與<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p001:m0096" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">太后</persName>同日謁太廟。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">后禀性淫亂，為妃時，便與外人姦通。在後宮，復通帝左右<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:m0026" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">楊珉之</persName>，與同寢處如伉儷。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:m0038" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">珉之</persName>又與帝相愛褻，故帝恣之。迎<rs id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:u0053" type="unresolved">后親戚</rs>入宮，賞賜人百數十萬。以<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:m0068" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>耀靈殿處后家屬。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:m0078" ref="iop_ybd_afm">帝</persName>被廢，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying:p002:m0082" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">后</persName>貶為王妃。</p>
</text>
